--- !u!114 &457410944
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 457410940}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: d53522a03c6caca41ab5f427992a27d3, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueController
  textComponent: {fileID: 518079234}
  interactText: {fileID: 747562142}
  yesButton: {fileID: 1826721043}
  noButton: {fileID: 300085927}
  lines1:
  - <b>Merchant:</b> Hello there stranger! I am the merchant of Nocturne Forest,
    and this is my shop! How can I help you?
  - <b>Jessie:</b> Hi, my name is Jessie. I heard of the legend about a mysterious
    object that is located somewhere in this forest. Can you help me find it?
  - <b>Merchant:</b> Ah, sure I can help you find it, but you should know that this
    forest is haunted.
  - <b>Jessie:</b> Haunted?? By who?
  - <b>Merchant:</b> By ghosts of course. However, there is a friendly Casper lookalike
    that may be of help to you. I suggest you find him.
  - <b>Jessie:</b> Where is he?
  - <b>Merchant:</b> Right by the maze entrance, last time I've seen him.
  - <b>Merchant:</b> Besides that fellow, I can help you by selling you various items.
  - <b>Merchant:</b> I have flashlight batteries and a maze map.
  - <b>Jessie:</b> You've mentioned a maze and now a maze map...?
  - <b>Merchant:</b> That's because in order to find the mysterious object, you'll
    need to go through that maze that's out there close to my shop.
  - <b>Merchant:</b> You can go into it blind, but good luck finding your way out
    like that. That's why I have the map.
  - '<b>Jessie:</b> Oh that makes sense. '
  - <b>Jessie:</b> Anyway, thank you very much for your help.
  - <b>Merchant:</b> You're very welcome. Be sure to find enough <b>coins throughout
    the forest</b> before trying to buy something.
  lines2:
  - <b>Jessie:</b> Oh! Hello there!
  - <b>Ghost:</b> .................
  - <i>This must be that Casper lookalike that man in the shop was talking about.</i>
  - <i>He doesn't seem to have much to say.</i>
  - <b>Jessie:</b> I'm Jessie, nice to meet you. That merchant in the shop said that
    you can help me find the mysterious object hidden in this forest.
  - <b>Jessie:</b> Will you help me?
  - <b>Ghost:</b> *nods*
  - <i>I suppose he'll follow me around as his way of helping, since he doesn't say
    much. </i>
  lines3:
  - <b>Jessie:</b> Hi, I'd like to buy a map.
  - <b>Merchant:</b> There you go! To use it, press the [M] key.
  - <b>Jessie:</b> Thank you very much!
  - <b>Merchant:</b> Good luck!
  - <b>Merchant:</b> Sorry, you don't have enough money.
  lines4: []
  lines5: []
  lines6: []
  textSpeed: 0.01
  inter: {fileID: 961739756}
  playStats: {fileID: 857741273}
  playerMove: {fileID: 2133503534}
